# The Sage Bird (Recursion)

> "The Fixed Point Combinator. Converts a Step into a Process. Folds Time into Space."

Y — це оператор, який знаходить "нерухому точку" функції.
Якщо $f$ — це "один крок еволюції", то $Y(f)$ — це "вічна еволюція".

$$Y = \lambda f.(\lambda x.f(x x))(\lambda x.f(x x))$$

## Wave Function

@[ts]
```typescript
// The Z-Combinator (Strict Y) allows recursion without named functions.
type Func<A, B> = (x: A) => B;
type RecursiveFunc<A, B> = (f: Func<A, B>) => Func<A, B>;

export const Y = <A, B>(f: RecursiveFunc<A, B>): Func<A, B> => {
  const g = (h: any) => (x: A) => f(h(h))(x);
  return g(g);
};

// Example Usage (Factorial):
// const fact = Y(f => n => n <= 1 ? 1 : n * f(n - 1));
```

@[sh]
```bash
# Y-Pattern for Bash: The "Fixed Point" Wrapper
# Usage: Y <function_name> <args>

Y() {
    local FUNC=$1
    shift
    local ARGS="$@"
    
    # The Fixed Point: Infinite Loop protected by Exit Code
    while true; do
        $FUNC $ARGS
        
        # Break the recursion if the function returns non-zero
        if [ $? -ne 0 ]; then break; fi
        
        # Breathe (anti-spin lock)
        sleep 1
    done
}
```

